{"sourceUrl":"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1035/7435.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:13.431240+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1035/7435.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>根据</span>2027<span>年推荐优秀应届本科毕业</span></span><span><span>生</span></span><span><span>免试攻读研究生（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免</span><span>”</span><span>）考核录取有关工作要求，经学院研究生招生工作领导小组研究决定，制订我院</span><span>2027</span><span>年推免考核录取工作实施细则如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、工作原则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>坚持科学、规范、公平、公开的原则</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>严格规范管理，</span></span><span><span>严守工作纪律，切实做好</span>2027<span>年推免招生各项工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、组织管理</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）学院研究生招生工作领导小组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：熊炜</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：王宽松</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：各</span></span><span><span>招生</span></span><span><span>系所招生工作负责人</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）学院研究生招生思想政治素质和品德考核小组</span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：王慷慨</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span><span>冯虹</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：各招生系所党支部书记、面试专家</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）综合考核小组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院成立学科专业综合考核小组，具体实施申请材料审核及学科专业面试考核工作。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院研究生招生考核监督小组</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：</span></span><span><span>冯虹</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：</span></span><span><span>学院领导、各招生系所主要负责人。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>三、招生专业</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院招生专业包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）学术学位：</span></span><span>071000<span>生物学；</span><span>100100</span><span>基础医学；</span><span>990400 </span><span>智能医学技术（</span></span><span><span>对应</span></span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年招生简章</span>0710Z3<span>生物医学工程与技术）</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）专业学位：</span></span><span>085400<span>电子信息；</span><span>086000</span><span>生物与医药</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>实际招生专业</span></span><span><span>以学校</span>2027<span>年推免生招生专业目录为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、申请条件</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）遵守中华人民共和国宪法和法律、诚实守信；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span>2027<span>届优秀本科毕业生，且有望取得所在学校推荐免试资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，具有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）具有良好的心理素质，身体健康状况符合国家规定的体检标准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请时间：</span></span><strong><span><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>10</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>前</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，通过</span><span>“</span><span>中南大学推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>进行网上报名。报名网址：</span><a href=\"https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></span></span></a><span>。</span></span><strong><span><span><span>网上报名</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>后请扫码加入微信通知群（选其中一群即可）</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/__local/7/90/53/4352A22CFCBF13974F457823BB3_0FF0BC19_9ABE.png\"/><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/__local/1/F6/72/010811EDB8780AA9F511D1B3C3A_E298456F_97F7.png\"/><br/></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五、资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>完成网上申请的学生于</span></span><strong><span><span>20</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>26</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9<span>月</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></strong><span><span>前提交资格审查材料至电子邮箱</span></span><strong><span><span>315024625@qq.com</span></span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><strong><span><span>邮件主题为</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>“</span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span><span>本科学校名称</span><span>+</span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，所有材料按顺序整理成一份</span>PDF<span>文件，</span></span><strong><span><span><span>文件命名为</span><span>“</span><span>推免申请</span><span>+</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>报考研究方向</span>+</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>姓名</span><span>”</span></span></span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>提交资格审查的材料如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）本人身份证和学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）网上报名《申请表》一份（网上提交申请后下载打印，不需要加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）个人简历；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（由所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单等外语水平证明；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（六）科研创新成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（七）获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（八）</span></span><span><span>本人签名的 <strong>《<span><a href=\"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&amp;owner=1071994251&amp;wbfileid=18201952\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：考生诚信考核承诺书.docx</a></span></strong></span></span><strong><span><span>》；</span></span></strong><span><span>申请人必须保证提交的申请信息及全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，若推免过程中存在弄虚作假情况，一经查实，将取消拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>六、材料审核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>学院根据申请人提交的申请材料，依据材料审核成绩择优筛选进入下一轮考核的考生名单。</span></span><span><span>筛选出的考核名单将在微信</span></span><span><span>通知</span></span><span><span>群公布。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>七、面试考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院按照推免考核工作要求组织面试，面试过程全程录音录像。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>面试时间、地点</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考核方式：线下面试；考核时间地点：</span></span><strong><span><span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>6</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>日</span>-1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>8</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，具体考核时间</span></span><span><span>段</span></span><span><span>和地点另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>考核内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span><span>专业基础测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>专业基础测试采取抽题问答或随机问答方式，满分为</span>100<span>分，</span><span>60</span><span>分合格，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span><span>综合素质及能力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>综合素质及能力测试采取随机问答方式，满分为</span>100<span>分，</span><span>60</span><span>分合格，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3</span><span>.</span><span><span>外语能力测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>外语能力测试采取笔试或听说交流方式，满分为</span>100<span>分，</span><span>60</span><span>分合格，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>总成绩计算</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>总成绩</span>=<span>专业基础测试</span><span>+</span><span>综合素质及能力测试</span><span>+</span><span>外语能力测试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>八</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>思想政治</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>素质和品德考核</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>与</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>心理测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.<span>思想政治素质和品德考核</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治表现考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span><span>心理健康测试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>根据《中南大学硕士研究生复试心理测验工作的说明》组织和实施，考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>九</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、录取</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>考核合格学生</span></span><span><span>取得正式推免资格后在教育部规定时间内登录教育部全国推免服务系统进行报名，并完成填报志愿，我校将根据学校推免录取实际情况发送复试通知，学生接受复试确认、接受待录取确认后，方可正式完成推免录取。推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>十</span></span><span><span>、其他</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span><span><span>本通知内容与教育主管部门及学校日后下达文件不符的，以教育主管部门及学校下达的文件为准。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>咨询、投诉受理：</span></span><span><span>联系人：易老师；电话：</span>0731-88660440<span>；邮箱：</span><span>315024625@qq.com</span><span>；地址：中南大学杏林校区孝骞楼</span><span>709</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>中南大学</span></span><span><span>湘雅基础医</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2026<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"69df56bdeb40c5095ae84350dc347d3cc02dcc81dbabb0ae3ed2ef0a58712880","textLength":1897,"sourceSha256":"4a26f09f7fe888b3d447a075898ad7c5070bcaa570753f6d66110797f31b4343","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2cac537d92dedd22791e","title":"2026年中南大学湘雅基础医学院2027年推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生考核录取工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:13.431240+00:00"}
